#: ../../../../../../../home/luke/Documents/qilisdk/docs/modules/backends/backends_qilisim.rst:2
msgid "QiliSim"
msgstr "QiliSim"

#: ../../../../../../../home/luke/Documents/qilisdk/docs/modules/backends/backends_qilisim.rst:14
msgid ""
"The **QiliSim** backend is the default CPU simulator developed by "
"Qilimanjaro and written in C++. It implements every primitive functional "
"natively, supports a noise model on all execution paths, and is included "
"with the core ``qilisdk`` installation — no extra dependency or hardware "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"El backend **QiliSim** es el simulador de CPU por defecto desarrollado "
"por Qilimanjaro y escrito en C++. Implementa todos los funcionales "
"primitivos de forma nativa, soporta un modelo de ruido en todas las rutas"
" de ejecución y se incluye con la instalación principal de ``qilisdk`` — "
"no requiere dependencias ni hardware adicionales."

